OL,3,AJournalist and pilot among three killed
OL,4,Aafter news helicopter crashes in LA
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhotojournalist Eliana Moreno and pilot
OL,7,FGeorge Marciniw have been named as
OL,8,Fbeing among three people killed after
OL,9,Fan NBC Los Angeles helicopter crashed
OL,10,Fin the city's suburbs, the station has
OL,11,Fconfirmed.
OL,13,FNBC Los Angeles said its NewsChopper4,
OL,14,Fwhich also operated for Telemundo 52,
OL,15,Fwas in the area on Tuesday reporting on
OL,16,Fa deadly bus crash which killed two
OL,17,Fpeople.
OL,19,FFire officials said an unidentified
OL,20,Fpedestrian was also killed, and two
OL,21,Fothers were taken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
