OL,3,AJournalist and pilot among three killed
OL,4,Aafter news helicopter crashes in LA
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes, including from the local news
OL,7,Fcommunity, have started to come in led
OL,8,Fby the station's hosts, who called the
OL,9,Fvictims "valued friends and
OL,10,Fcolleagues". One CBS editor said their
OL,11,F"hearts are shattered".
